@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+### Added
+- Neuron segmentation jobs now have an "Affinity threshold" advanced setting to tune how readily neighboring voxels are merged into one segment.
+
+### Changed
+- Custom configuration overrides for AI training, inference and alignment jobs are now restricted to super users.
